  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WNBA </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR</a></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Check out the <strong><a href=\"https://yahoosports.com/am?.tsrc=1317&amp;ncid=crm_-2348335-20261009-1--A&amp;utm_content=mktg_1317_di_-2348335-20261009-1--A&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=email&amp;bt_user_id=SrjGgvZlBf5qIZUVu7yYI1CqlkUyD55KDXbV%2BKpd15uedTV17eKJtcMAhxssnZ11ayDylgxSDVgRNS4WgjqkPZPBV36yuhe3WjW0KlumYYM0G8xcJYj%2F85w0Ks9Zo1at&amp;bt_ts=1791548043236\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yahoo! Sports AM newsletter</a></strong> for my various charts and other contributions!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179267165167099efe5e6bf0e/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FALL CLASSIC? MORE LIKE SMALL CLASSIC</a></strong> - I examined how the Milwaukee Brewers and Tampa Bay Rays — two model small-market franchises with below-league-average power — built the best teams in their leagues by leaning into great rosters and, yes, “small ball” tactics.</p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/e3foh/2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ba58425e-3f92-4eab-b2af-1ff60b634932_1220x1164.png\" alt=\"Neither the Rays nor Brewers rely much on the HR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Neither the Rays nor Brewers rely much on the HR</p></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://view.newsletters.yahoo.net/messages/179275935199241560b79c6e6/raw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">THE OILERS’ OFFENSE IS OFF THE CHARTS </a></strong>- I broke down Connor McDavid and the Edmonton Oilers’ scorching offensive start to the new NHL season, looking at the stats behind their league-leading goal production — and whether it can be enough to finally win the Cup.</p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/ZvZwG/3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/115ae288-71d2-44af-89db-825a3031a147_1220x1218.png\" alt=\"McDavid is off to his hottest start ever\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>McDavid is off to his hottest start ever</p></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/which-players-saved-their-best-baseball\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Which Players Saved Their Best Baseball for October?</a></strong> - From one-October wonders to perennial playoff heroes, I dug into <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/190966113/2026-mlb-wins-above-replacement-leaderboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">my postseason WAR data</a> to see which MLB players built careers most defined by playoff greatness relative to their regular-season standards.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-indiana-pacers-lost-a-season\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Indiana Pacers Lost a Season. Did They Lose Their Moment?</a></strong> - Ahead of this week’s 2026-27 NBA season tip-off, I examined whether the Indiana Pacers can pull off a “<a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-rise-of-the-championship-gap?utm_source=publication-search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">championship gap year</a>” and jump right back into title contention following a franchise-low 19-win season.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-eagles-are-often-saved-by-their\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Eagles Are Often Saved by Their Backup QBs. Probably Not This Time.</a></strong> - Following Jalen Hurts’ terrible <a href=\"https://www.nfl.com/news/eagles-qb-jalen-hurts-out-2026-season-blood-clots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">season-ending blood clot diagnosis</a>, I looked back at Philadelphia’s long history of backup QBs rescuing lost seasons — and why Tanner McKee faces much longer odds than past heroes like Jeff Garcia or Nick Foles.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/screw-the-haters-brewers-rays-could\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Screw the Haters. Brewers-Rays Could Be an All-Time World Series.</a></strong> - As TV executives worry about ratings for the 2026 World Series, I say… who cares? Here’s why the Fall Classic matchup between a pair of regular-season powerhouses could deliver old-school, but also great and exciting, baseball.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/where-do-the-rams-fit-in-the-nfls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Where Do the Rams Fit in the NFL’s History of Superteam Cautionary Tales?</a></strong> - After the preseason undefeated-season hype evaporated into early-season stumbles, I analyzed where Los Angeles’ star-studded roster fits among NFL “Superteams” that struggled to meet expectations.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50253437/most-least-transfer-value-added\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Men’s college basketball teams that gained -- and lost -- most in the transfer portal</a></strong> - Ahead of the rapidly looming college hoops season, I used <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/48424179/mens-college-basketball-transfer-portal-player-rankings-commitments-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">transfer-portal rankings</a> for men’s Division I basketball to identify which programs scored the biggest roster upgrades and which suffered the most losses.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/10/22/larsons-title-favorite-status-slips-ahead-of-talladega-as-bell-others-close-in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Larson’s title-favorite status slips ahead of Talladega as Bell, others close in</a></strong> - For  this week ahead of Talladega, I analyzed how Kyle Larson’s once-dominant championship projection <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">has begun to slip in my model</a>, with Christopher Bell and other playoff drivers closing the gap in the Cup Series title race</p>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/3AQKq7tANBkK99zb8zVRFl?si=rfmpFT3nT0OqVkAZiwc8vw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: The Chase is Back On</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I broke down Fellow Tyler (Reddick)’s win at Phoenix — how cool would a season bookended by Reddick win-streaks be? — and debated if Larson is even the Chase favorite anymore, before looking ahead to scary, chaotic Talladega.</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On the World Series’ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/different-teams-same-game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">biggest pre-series market favorites</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/DFdv2/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d072f350-02aa-4487-98ab-20eb5fa05cde_1220x1552.png\" alt=\"The biggest modern pre-World Series favorites\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The biggest modern pre-World Series favorites</p></div>\n<p>🏀<strong> </strong><em><strong>On LeBron and the Sixers’ <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/different-teams-same-game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">massive Thursday comeback</a> …</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/XGhRC/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dd380583-ad5c-42fb-91ea-fda071b5567b_1220x1012.png\" alt=\"Philly special\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Philly special</p></div>\n<p>🏀<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/roster-roulette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">worst back-to-back games of the year</a> for the Valkyries…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/U5XDF/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7bfee7ad-c6c4-4d10-a607-ea138cea0261_1220x1020.png\" alt=\"This Dream is a nightmare\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>This Dream is a nightmare</p></div>\n<p>🏀<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/roster-roulette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">most lopsided opening-week days</a> of an NBA season…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/ehSE5/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8fb67411-7960-420a-97f0-7db129ab2774_1220x922.png\" alt=\"Starting the season on a lopsided note\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Starting the season on a lopsided note</p></div>\n<p>🏀<em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/221482523/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how the Sixers are sharing</a> that “one basketball” so far…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/KFSPX/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/60615cdc-3373-4537-b118-ef0960d4fc2f_1220x1298.png\" alt=\"How the LeBron Sixers are splitting the pie\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>How the LeBron Sixers are splitting the pie</p></div>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/which-world-series-paths-were-the?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=220892368&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Which World Series Paths Were the Toughest?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://betweenthepipes.substack.com/p/4-charts-that-describe-the-2026-world?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1274895&amp;post_id=198911786&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“4 charts that describe the 2026 World Series matchup”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://michaelcecchini.substack.com/p/yandy-and-the-ugly-downside-of-the?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2245735&amp;post_id=221570197&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Yandy &amp; The Ugly Downside of the Challenge System”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://zanananananananabatman.substack.com/p/the-hunt-for-neutral-october?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=4730309&amp;post_id=197731635&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The Hunt For Neutral October”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://baseballspast.substack.com/p/the-1920-class-of-spitballers?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=6364294&amp;post_id=221042340&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The 1920 Class of Spitballers”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://www.basketballpoetry.com/p/one-takeaway-from-every-teams-opening-4da?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=517515&amp;post_id=221653254&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“One takeaway from every team’s opening 2026-27 game”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<l